# Estimate: 17 tasks x 2 reps = 34 conversations

Based on `baseline`: 34 measured conversations covering 17 of 17 tasks.

- input tokens: about 520,000
- output tokens: about 60,000
- t12 and t09 carry 56% of the input tokens. Dropping reps there changes the total most.

## Against `v1` (34 conversations)

| | estimate | actual |
| --- | ---: | ---: |
| input tokens | 520,000 | 538,293 |
| output tokens | 60,000 | 54,777 |

Not counted: what a coding assistant uses while it reads and edits around the run. No prices are applied.
